                "description": "Deltana S45BBN- 4-1/2 x 4-1/2 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Durable Steel Hinge with 2 Ball Bearings, Non-Removable Pin.  S45BBN. 0.134 thick (gauge). Package includes a pair of hinges with wood and machine screws. Available in 8 finish colors.",
